My two cents: a new type of golem, the weapons golem.  Basically, Edward
Scissorhands taken to his logical conclusion.  Allow it to use any number of 
weapons (or maybe just a large number like eight):

The weapons golem swings its 17 broad swords!  The weapons golem hits! -more-
The weapons golem swings its two handed sword!  The weapons golem hits! -more-
The weapons golem swings its 31 daggers!  The weapons golem hits! -more-
The weapons golem swings its 4 runed spears!  The weapons golem hits! -more-
The weapons golem swings its battle axe!  The weapons golem hits! -more-
You die... -more-


